# data.gov.sg (singapore-city-pulse): Singapore's real-time APIs. A snapshot of
# a past time never changes and is kept a month (a week of taxis every half hour
# is about 17 MB, a month of rain days about 25 MB); the latest ones a minute or
# a few.
proxy_cache_path /var/cache/nginx/datagovsg levels=1:2 keys_zone=datagovsg:10m
                 max_size=500m inactive=30d use_temp_path=off;
